<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Cap Gemini.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Cap Gemini.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. in New York, Frankfurt branch, has issued four million American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on Cap Gemini Sogeti, lead manager Citibank S.A said..</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS.</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   07.APR.97	    SPOT REFERENCE 338 FRF</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		  MIN EXER LOT   1000</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	STRIKE     PRICE    MATURITY     PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	375 FRF    6.10 FRF 07.APR.98    18.05 PCT 5.5 X</p>
<p> PUT	 425 FRF    7.20 FRF 07.APR.99    21.30 PCT 4.7 X</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE   CITIWAR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
